@startuml
title 用户登录顺序图

actor User
participant LoginUI
participant LoginController
database UserDB
participant SessionManager

User -> LoginUI : 1. selectLoginMode(mode)

User -> LoginUI : 2. inputLoginInfo(mode, info)

LoginUI -> LoginController : 3. requestLoginAuth(mode, info)

LoginController -> UserDB : 4. verifyLoginInfo(mode, info)

UserDB --> LoginController : 5. returnVerifyResult(result)

alt 验证通过
    LoginController -> SessionManager : 6. generateSession(userId)
    SessionManager -> SessionManager : 7. createSessionRecord(userId, token)
    SessionManager --> LoginController : 8. returnSessionToken(token)
    LoginController -> LoginUI : 9. showLoginResult(success, token)
else 验证失败
    LoginController -> LoginUI : 9. showLoginResult(failure, null)
end

LoginUI --> User : 显示登录结果\n成功则跳转论坛首页

@enduml
